{"seq":3,"slug":"svg-path-animations","title":"SVG 路径动画：线条绘制、路径形变与 stroke-dashoffset","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/advanced/svg-path-animations","wordCount":827,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"svg-路径动画-线条绘制-路径形变与-stroke-dashoffset\">SVG 路径动画：线条绘制、路径形变与 stroke-dashoffset</h1><p>SVG 动画是 Web 动画中独特的一个分支，其核心技术 <code>stroke-dashoffset</code> 和路径形变（morphing）依赖 SVG 特有的属性和算法。一个手写签名动画、一个加载进度圆弧、一个 logo 线条绘制——这些效果都建立在本文介绍的技术基础上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"stroke-dashoffset-线条绘制动画原理\">stroke-dashoffset：线条绘制动画原理</h2><p>SVG <code>stroke-dasharray</code> 属性将描边分割成虚线段，<code>stroke-dashoffset</code> 控制虚线模式的偏移量。两者结合可以模拟「手写」线条效果：</p>\n<p><strong>原理</strong>：将整个路径设置为一段等于路径总长度的虚线（实线段=路径长，虚线段=0），通过动画 <code>stroke-dashoffset</code> 从路径全长变化到 0，视觉上实现线条从无到有的绘制效果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 1. 获取路径总长度&#10;const path = document.querySelector(&#39;.draw-path&#39;);&#10;const length = path.getTotalLength();&#10;&#10;// 2. 设置初始状态：整条路径为&quot;虚&quot;&#10;path.style.strokeDasharray = length;&#10;path.style.strokeDashoffset = length;&#10;&#10;// 3. 动画 dashoffset 到 0：线条「绘制」出来&#10;path.style.transition = &#39;stroke-dashoffset 2s ease-in-out&#39;;&#10;requestAnimationFrame(() =&gt; {&#10;  path.style.strokeDashoffset = 0;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. 获取路径总长度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.draw-path'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTotalLength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 设置初始状态：整条路径为\"虚\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path.style.strokeDasharray </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path.style.strokeDashoffset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 动画 dashoffset 到 0：线条「绘制」出来</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path.style.transition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'stroke-dashoffset 2s ease-in-out'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  path.style.strokeDashoffset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"css-实现-更简洁\">CSS 实现：更简洁</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".path-draw {&#10;  stroke-dasharray: 1000; /* 设为足够大的值 */&#10;  stroke-dashoffset: 1000;&#10;  animation: draw-line 2s ease-in-out forwards;&#10;}&#10;&#10;@keyframes draw-line {&#10;  to {&#10;    stroke-dashoffset: 0;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.path-draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  stroke-dasharray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 设为足够大的值 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  stroke-dashoffset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: draw-line </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease-in-out</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> forwards</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> draw-line</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    stroke-dashoffset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意</strong>：CSS <code>stroke-dasharray</code> 需要预知路径长度。动态路径需要 JavaScript 计算 <code>getTotalLength()</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"framer-motion-的-pathlength-抽象\">Framer Motion 的 pathLength 抽象</h2><p>Framer Motion 将 <code>stroke-dashoffset</code> 模式抽象为更友好的 <code>pathLength</code> 属性（值域 0-1），自动处理路径长度计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { motion } from &#39;framer-motion&#39;;&#10;import { useState } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function CheckmarkIcon() {&#10;  const [completed, setCompleted] = useState(false);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; onClick={() =&gt; setCompleted(true)}&gt;&#10;      &lt;motion.path&#10;        d=&quot;M 3 12 L 10 19 L 21 5&quot;&#10;        stroke=&quot;#22c55e&quot;&#10;        strokeWidth=&quot;2&quot;&#10;        fill=&quot;none&quot;&#10;        strokeLinecap=&quot;round&quot;&#10;        strokeLinejoin=&quot;round&quot;&#10;        initial={{ pathLength: 0 }}&#10;        animate={{ pathLength: completed ? 1 : 0 }}&#10;        transition={{ duration: 0.5, ease: &#39;easeOut&#39; }}&#10;      /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 进度圆弧&#10;function ProgressCircle({ progress }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 100 100&quot;&gt;&#10;      {/* 背景轨道 */}&#10;      &lt;circle cx=&quot;50&quot; cy=&quot;50&quot; r=&quot;45&quot; stroke=&quot;#e5e7eb&quot; strokeWidth=&quot;8&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; /&gt;&#10;      {/* 进度弧 */}&#10;      &lt;motion.circle&#10;        cx=&quot;50&quot;&#10;        cy=&quot;50&quot;&#10;        r=&quot;45&quot;&#10;        stroke=&quot;#3b82f6&quot;&#10;        strokeWidth=&quot;8&quot;&#10;        fill=&quot;none&quot;&#10;        strokeLinecap=&quot;round&quot;&#10;        style={{ rotate: -90 }} /* 从顶部开始 */&#10;        initial={{ pathLength: 0 }}&#10;        animate={{ pathLength: progress / 100 }}&#10;        transition={{ duration: 0.8, ease: &#39;easeOut&#39; }}&#10;      /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { motion } from 'framer-motion';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { useState } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function CheckmarkIcon() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [completed, setCompleted] = useState(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" onClick={() => setCompleted(true)}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;motion.path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        d=\"M 3 12 L 10 19 L 21 5\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stroke=\"#22c55e\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        strokeWidth=\"2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fill=\"none\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        strokeLinecap=\"round\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        strokeLinejoin=\"round\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        initial={{ pathLength: 0 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animate={{ pathLength: completed ? 1 : 0 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        transition={{ duration: 0.5, ease: 'easeOut' }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/svg></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 进度圆弧</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function ProgressCircle({ progress }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {/* 背景轨道 */}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"45\" stroke=\"#e5e7eb\" strokeWidth=\"8\" fill=\"none\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {/* 进度弧 */}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;motion.circle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cx=\"50\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cy=\"50\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        r=\"45\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stroke=\"#3b82f6\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        strokeWidth=\"8\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fill=\"none\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        strokeLinecap=\"round\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        style={{ rotate: -90 }} /* 从顶部开始 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        initial={{ pathLength: 0 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animate={{ pathLength: progress / 100 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        transition={{ duration: 0.8, ease: 'easeOut' }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/svg></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多路径序列绘制\">多路径序列绘制</h2><p>对于复杂 SVG 图形，按顺序绘制多条路径可以创造「手绘」感：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PathConfig {&#10;  selector: string;&#10;  duration: number;&#10;  delay: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function drawSVGSequence(paths: PathConfig[]) {&#10;  paths.forEach(({ selector, duration, delay }) =&gt; {&#10;    const path = document.querySelector&lt;SVGPathElement&gt;(selector);&#10;    if (!path) return;&#10;&#10;    const length = path.getTotalLength();&#10;    path.style.strokeDasharray = String(length);&#10;    path.style.strokeDashoffset = String(length);&#10;&#10;    path.animate([{ strokeDashoffset: length }, { strokeDashoffset: 0 }], {&#10;      duration: duration * 1000,&#10;      delay: delay * 1000,&#10;      easing: &#39;ease-in-out&#39;,&#10;      fill: &#39;forwards&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用&#10;drawSVGSequence([&#10;  { selector: &#39;.path-outline&#39;, duration: 1.5, delay: 0 },&#10;  { selector: &#39;.path-detail-1&#39;, duration: 0.8, delay: 1.0 },&#10;  { selector: &#39;.path-detail-2&#39;, duration: 0.8, delay: 1.5 },&#10;]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PathConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  duration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  delay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> drawSVGSequence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">paths</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PathConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  paths.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">delay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SVGPathElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(selector);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTotalLength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path.style.strokeDasharray </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(length);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path.style.strokeDashoffset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(length);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">animate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([{ strokeDashoffset: length }, { strokeDashoffset: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }], {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      duration: duration </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      delay: delay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      easing: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ease-in-out'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      fill: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'forwards'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawSVGSequence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { selector: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.path-outline'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, delay: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { selector: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.path-detail-1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, delay: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { selector: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.path-detail-2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, delay: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"路径形变-morphing-flubber-算法\">路径形变（Morphing）：flubber 算法</h2><p>SVG 路径形变要求两条路径有相同数量和类型的路径命令点，否则直接插值会产生扭曲效果。<code>flubber</code> 库通过算法对路径点进行重采样和对齐，实现任意形状之间的平滑形变：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { interpolate } from &#39;flubber&#39;;&#10;&#10;const star = &#39;M 50 5 L 61 35 L 95 35 L 68 57 L 79 91 L 50 70 L 21 91 L 32 57 L 5 35 L 39 35 Z&#39;;&#10;const circle = &#39;M 95 50 A 45 45 0 1 0 5 50 A 45 45 0 1 0 95 50 Z&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 创建插值函数&#10;const interpolator = interpolate(star, circle);&#10;&#10;// 在动画帧中使用&#10;let progress = 0;&#10;function animate() {&#10;  progress = Math.min(progress + 0.01, 1);&#10;  path.setAttribute(&#39;d&#39;, interpolator(progress));&#10;&#10;  if (progress &lt; 1) {&#10;    requestAnimationFrame(animate);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;requestAnimationFrame(animate);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { interpolate } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'flubber'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> star</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'M 50 5 L 61 35 L 95 35 L 68 57 L 79 91 L 50 70 L 21 91 L 32 57 L 5 35 L 39 35 Z'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> circle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'M 95 50 A 45 45 0 1 0 5 50 A 45 45 0 1 0 95 50 Z'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 创建插值函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> interpolator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> interpolate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(star, circle);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在动画帧中使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> progress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> animate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  progress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(progress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">interpolator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(progress));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (progress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(animate);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(animate);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>与 GSAP MorphSVG 插件配合</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { gsap } from &#39;gsap&#39;;&#10;import { MorphSVGPlugin } from &#39;gsap/MorphSVGPlugin&#39;;&#10;&#10;gsap.registerPlugin(MorphSVGPlugin);&#10;&#10;// MorphSVG 自动处理路径点对齐&#10;gsap.to(&#39;#star&#39;, {&#10;  duration: 1.5,&#10;  morphSVG: &#39;#circle&#39;,&#10;  ease: &#39;power2.inOut&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 从字符串到字符串&#10;gsap.to(&#39;#path&#39;, {&#10;  duration: 2,&#10;  morphSVG: &#39;M 50 50 L ...&#39;,&#10;  repeat: -1,&#10;  yoyo: true,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { gsap } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gsap'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { MorphSVGPlugin } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gsap/MorphSVGPlugin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(MorphSVGPlugin);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// MorphSVG 自动处理路径点对齐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#star'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  morphSVG: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#circle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'power2.inOut'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 从字符串到字符串</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#path'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  morphSVG: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'M 50 50 L ...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  repeat: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  yoyo: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"svg-动画的坐标系与-viewbox\">SVG 动画的坐标系与 viewBox</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[SVG 坐标系统] --&gt; B[&quot;viewBox: 内部坐标系&lt;br/&gt;viewBox=&#39;0 0 100 100&#39;&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;width/height: 外部显示尺寸&lt;br/&gt;可用 CSS 控制&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;内部坐标与外部尺寸解耦&lt;br/&gt;动画用内部坐标计算&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[SVG 坐标系统] --&gt; B[\"viewBox: 内部坐标系&lt;br/&gt;viewBox='0 0 100 100'\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"width/height: 外部显示尺寸&lt;br/&gt;可用 CSS 控制\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"内部坐标与外部尺寸解耦&lt;br/&gt;动画用内部坐标计算\"]</pre><p><strong>关键原则</strong>：SVG 动画中的坐标值（<code>x</code>、<code>y</code>、<code>cx</code>、<code>cy</code> 等）是 viewBox 坐标空间中的值，不受 CSS <code>width</code>/<code>height</code> 缩放影响。<code>getTotalLength()</code> 也返回 viewBox 空间中的长度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"svg-动画性能\">SVG 动画性能</h2><p>SVG 路径形变（<code>morphSVG</code>/<code>flubber</code>）在每帧都需要修改 <code>d</code> 属性，这会触发 Paint。与 <code>transform</code>/<code>opacity</code> 相比，性能较低，但通常在可接受范围：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动画类型</th>\n<th>触发阶段</th>\n<th>性能等级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>stroke-dashoffset</code></td>\n<td>Composite</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transform</code> / <code>opacity</code></td>\n<td>Composite</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fill</code>、<code>stroke</code> 颜色</td>\n<td>Paint</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>d</code> 属性（路径形变）</td>\n<td>Paint</td>\n<td>中等（避免大型复杂路径）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>x</code>、<code>y</code>、<code>cx</code>、<code>cy</code></td>\n<td>Layout</td>\n<td>较差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于路径形变，限制同帧动画的 SVG 元素数量，并降低路径点密度（使用简化后的 SVG）可以显著改善性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>stroke-dasharray</strong>：将 SVG 描边分割为虚线段；设置为路径总长度时，整条路径显示为一段实线</li>\n<li><strong>stroke-dashoffset</strong>：控制虚线模式的偏移量；从路径长度动画到 0，视觉上实现线条从无到有的绘制</li>\n<li><strong>getTotalLength()</strong>：SVG <code>SVGGeometryElement</code> 的方法，返回路径在 viewBox 坐标空间中的总长度</li>\n<li><strong>pathLength</strong>：Framer Motion 对 <code>stroke-dashoffset</code> 的友好抽象，值域 0-1，自动处理路径长度计算</li>\n<li><strong>路径形变（morphing）</strong>：通过逐帧修改 SVG 路径的 <code>d</code> 属性实现形状变换；要求两条路径点数相同，或使用 flubber 重采样对齐</li>\n<li><strong>flubber</strong>：处理任意形状间形变的算法库，通过路径重采样使起点终点具有相同结构</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>SVG 路径动画的核心技术是 <code>stroke-dashoffset</code> 驱动的线条绘制效果，配合 <code>getTotalLength()</code> 获取精确路径长度。路径形变需要额外算法（flubber/MorphSVG）处理点数对齐。性能上，<code>stroke-dashoffset</code> 仅触发 Composite，是 SVG 动画中最优的选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章导航\">本章导航</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"layout-animations\">布局动画</a> — FLIP 技术与 AutoAnimate</li>\n<li>章节概览：<a href=\"../advanced/\">进阶技术</a></li>\n<li>下一章：<a href=\"../performance/\">性能与模式</a> — 动画性能优化、编排与无障碍</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SVG 路径动画：线条绘制、路径形变与 stroke-dashoffset","id":"svg-路径动画-线条绘制-路径形变与-stroke-dashoffset"},{"level":2,"text":"stroke-dashoffset：线条绘制动画原理","id":"stroke-dashoffset-线条绘制动画原理"},{"level":3,"text":"CSS 实现：更简洁","id":"css-实现-更简洁"},{"level":2,"text":"Framer Motion 的 pathLength 抽象","id":"framer-motion-的-pathlength-抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"多路径序列绘制","id":"多路径序列绘制"},{"level":2,"text":"路径形变（Morphing）：flubber 算法","id":"路径形变-morphing-flubber-算法"},{"level":2,"text":"SVG 动画的坐标系与 viewBox","id":"svg-动画的坐标系与-viewbox"},{"level":2,"text":"SVG 动画性能","id":"svg-动画性能"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章导航","id":"本章导航"}],"prev":{"title":"布局动画：FLIP 技术原理与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/advanced/layout-animations"},"next":{"title":"动画性能优化：jank 诊断、合成层管理与 GPU 预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/performance/animation-performance"}}